# Supp.E/E6_Electrical validation report

Status: **model prediction only** — not FPGA-validated, not post-layout
extracted. The values below are the ones used in Appendix B, Tables 1.2
and 1.3 of the manuscript.

## Parameters (7-nm FinFET, ASAP7 / IRDS 2023)

| Symbol        | Value        | Source                         |
|---------------|--------------|--------------------------------|
| tau           | 12 ps        | Min-size 2-input NAND, TT/25C  |
| R0            | 2.5 kOhm     | 7-nm standard-cell inverter    |
| C0            | 0.30 fF      | 7-nm standard-cell inverter    |
| r_v           | 0.15 Ohm/um  | ASAP7 M13                      |
| c_v           | 0.20 fF/um   | ASAP7 M13 (incl. fringe)       |
| Delta_x       | 0.80 um      | Floorplan, Section 7.4.1       |
| k             | 16           | Repeater pitch                 |
| s             | 8            | Driver scale                   |
| R_VSW         | 280 Ohm      | Section 1.3.C                  |
| R_HSW         | 220 Ohm      | Section 1.3.C                  |
| t_level_rest  | 0.3 tau      | Section 1.3.C                  |
| t_sense       | 0.5 tau      | Section 1.3.F                  |

## Corrected segment delay

    t_seg / tau = 2.34     (includes k * R_HSW series resistance)
    t_bus(W)/tau = 2.34 * floor(W/16) + 0.5
    t_step2(W)/tau = 2.34 * floor(W/16) + 5.5

## Budget and regime boundary

    c_bus(T_clk) = (T_clk / tau) - 6

    T_clk = 1.22 ns  ->  c_bus = 95.7  ->  W_max = 640
    T_clk = 1.50 ns  ->  c_bus = 119.0 ->  W_max = 800

## Reproduce

    python3 Supp.E/electrical_report/E6_tables_1_2_1_3.py

prints the rows of Appendix B Tables 1.2 and 1.3.

## What is NOT claimed

- No post-layout RC extraction has been performed.
- No SPICE simulation of the bus has been performed.
- No PVT corner analysis (TT/FF/SS) has been performed.
- No charge-sharing or noise-margin bound is claimed.

These remain future work, as stated in Sections 9.4 and 10.2.
